---
## License Acceptance

Running the GalixiHub container requires acceptance of the GalixiHub 
license.

The license terms are available at:
https://galixsys-networks.com/hub-terms-and-conditions/

Before starting the server ensure the following value is set in 
galixihub.env:
  GALIXIHUB_ACCEPT_LICENSE=YES


If the license is not accepted the container will exit during startup.

---
## Docker Image

The official GalixiHub Docker image is distributed through Docker Hub 
and will be automatically downloaded when starting the stack.

